# Phase 1 Walkthrough — Feature Engineering & Smoke Test

## Changes Made

### [feature_engineer.py](file:///c:/Politechnika/Masters/Thesis%20-%202/feature_engineer.py) — Full implementation

All 12 method bodies implemented (were previously `pass` stubs):

| Method | Implementation |
|---|---|
| `add_high_low_spread` | `(High - Low) / Low` — plain Pandas |
| `add_close_open_spread` | `(Close - Open) / Open` — plain Pandas |
| `add_bollinger_bands` | `df.ta.bbands(length=20, std=2, append=True)` |
| `add_atr` | `df.ta.atr(length=14, append=True)` |
| `add_sma` | `df.ta.sma(length=10/20, append=True)` |
| `add_ema` | `df.ta.ema(length=10/20, append=True)` |
| `add_macd` | `df.ta.macd(fast=12, slow=26, signal=9, append=True)` |
| `add_rsi` | `df.ta.rsi(length=14, append=True)` |
| `add_vwap` | Custom daily-reset VWAP via `groupby(date).cumsum()` |
| `add_obv` | `df.ta.obv(append=True)` |
| `add_all_features` | Orchestrator — calls all methods, renames columns, drops NaN |
| `get_feature_names` | Returns ordered list of feature names |

**Key design decisions:**
- **Column renaming:** pandas-ta generates names like `BBL_20_2.0`, `ATRr_14` etc. A `_RENAME_MAP` dict remaps these to our clean convention (`BB_Low`, `ATR`).
- **Auxiliary columns dropped:** pandas-ta's Bollinger `BBB`/`BBP` and MACD signal line are removed (not in our feature set).
- **NaN handling:** 33 leading rows dropped from warm-up of rolling windows (SMA_20, BB_20, MACD_26).

